From 7a417c8fa0aae6a9a713bd0670d6f5ee92813175 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 04:29:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Pretraining: tokenizer health logging, broader init guard,
 fixed-tokenizer launchers

- train_r2r.py logs the spatial tokenizer's weight norm, bias norm and weight
  gradient norm every log_steps (TensorBoard map/* and the text log), so a
  dead raster path is visible within minutes instead of after 460k steps.
- The start-up guard now covers every parameter: non-finite anywhere, or
  all-zero convolution / map-encoder matrices, abort; other all-zero matrices
  (some are zero by design) are logged as warnings.
- scripts/submit/llm-grid-try5-pretrain-fixedtok.sh re-runs the LLM-Grid Try5
  pretraining from the ETP-R1 release weights with the fix in place, with
  preflight checks that the checkout carries patch 0017; extra arguments go
  to train_r2r.py. Output dir pretrained/r2r_rxr_ce/llm_grid_try5_fixedtok.
- run_r2r/main_server.bash gains llm_grid_try5_fixedtok_dagger and its eval,
  loading the pretrained map modules (load_pretrained_map_modules True);
  scripts/submit/llm-grid-try5-fixedtok-dagger.sh submits it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xm3S8jGTjU1YqXnUPuWMgH
---
 pretrain_src/pretrain_src/train_r2r.py        | 54 ++++++++++++++-----
 run_r2r/main_server.bash                      | 23 ++++++++
 .../submit/llm-grid-try5-fixedtok-dagger.sh   | 11 ++++
 .../submit/llm-grid-try5-pretrain-fixedtok.sh | 28 ++++++++++
 4 files changed, 103 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)
